{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"malet_encounter","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/0","jump":null,"original_index":99,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_malet_cellar.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"The cellar was three levels below street. The air down here tasted like copper and old paper.","text_ko":"지하실은 거리에서 세 층 아래였다. 이곳 공기에서는 구리와 오래된 종이 맛이 났다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"They waited. Thirty minutes. Arrel sat with his back to the wall, an old habit he could not remember learning.","text_ko":"그들은 기다렸다. 삼십 분. 아렐은 벽에 등을 붙이고 앉았다, 배운 기억이 없는, 오래된 습관이었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/chapter_expansion/ch02_malet_from_gray_v1.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Malet appeared as if he had always been there. Small, thin, dressed in gray that matched the walls.","text_ko":"말렛은 처음부터 그 자리에 있었던 것처럼 나타났다. 작고, 마르고, 벽과 같은 회색 옷차림."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"His eyes were wrong. Too vivid. Amber that caught light that wasn't there. High-grade Memory Ampoules.","text_ko":"눈이 잘못되어 있었다. 지나치게 선명했다. 있지도 않은 빛을 받아내는 호박색. 고등급 기억 앰풀."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_malet_cellar.png","portrait":"malet_amused"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"You killed something in the Achen Forest. Three days ago. A Void Beast, Grade... moderate.","text_ko":"아켄 숲에서 뭔가를 죽이셨더군요. 사흘 전. 보이드 비스트, 등급은... 중간쯤."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_warning"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"The Authority detected the combustion signature. They have a fix on the general area. Two days, maybe less, before they narrow it.","text_ko":"관리국이 연소 시그니처를 감지했습니다. 대략적인 위치는 이미 잡혔고요. 좁혀 오기까지 이틀, 어쩌면 더 짧을 수도."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"I need a route to BL-07.","text_ko":"BL-07로 가는 경로가 필요해."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{"portrait":"malet_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"Seventeen people have asked me that question. None of them came back whole.","text_ko":"그 질문을 한 사람이 열일곱이었습니다. 온전하게 돌아온 사람은 없었죠."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/8","jump":null,"original_index":8,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_malet_cellar.png","portrait":"malet_price_revealed"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":8,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":8,"text":{"speaker":"Malet","text":"My price: the day you first held a sword.","text_ko":"제 값은, 당신이 처음 검을 잡은 날입니다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[{"action":{},"effect_phase":"flags_burn_cost_then_rewards_nonblocking","effects":{"burn_memory":"identity_first_sword","set_flag":"malet_deal_accepted"},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/9/choice/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":0,"original_index":9,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"text":"Accept the deal.","text_ko":"거래를 받아들인다."}},{"action":{},"effect_phase":"flags_burn_cost_then_rewards_nonblocking","effects":{"set_flag":"malet_deal_refused"},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/9/choice/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":1,"original_index":9,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"text":"Refuse.","text_ko":"거절하다."}}],"choices_present":true,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_encounter/9","jump":null,"original_index":9,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":9,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":9,"text":{}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"8fadf93e1eb05111b17d148a89ad49ef88d8a9a4c9c0cb038a8d43adb216821f","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
